[I] Library with common API for various MATE modules

[T] mate-desktop contains the libmate-desktop library, the mate-about program
[T] as well as some desktop-wide documents. The libmate-desktop library
[T] provides API shared by several applications on the desktop, but that cannot
[T] live in the platform for various reasons.

[U] https://mate-desktop.org/

[A] MATE developer
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/desktop/mate
[F] CROSS

[E] opt systemd

[L] GPL
[V] 1.29.1
[P] X -----5---9 177.200

[D] 6a03ae6162e3d43f029cbf336532ab17db149e42b74bfb573e6f12d0 mate-desktop-1.29.1.tar.gz https://github.com/mate-desktop/mate-desktop/archive/v1.29.1/

. $base/package/*/*/mate-conf.in NO_SANITY_CHECK

pkginstalled gobject-introspection && var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dintrospection=true
pkginstalled gtk-doc docbook-xml docbook-xsl && var_append mesonopt ' ' -Dgtk-doc=true
